  "items": [
    {
      "name": "Impossibilities Abound",
      "type": "feature",
      "system": {
        "featureForm": "passive",
        "description": "<p>Convergence is a nexus of gods, monsters, aliens, and all manner of dimension-hoppers. Because mortal life is generally beneath these beings' concern, PCs have disadvantage on action rolls to influence them unless they have leverage against them or know what the NPC cares about.</p><section id=\"secret-IkUNHWoZWhXKxHAt\" class=\"secret\"><p>What manner of being currently holds sway in the city? What strange customs do they practice? Which PC is most confused or off ended by them, and which PC adopts these customs as their own?</p></section>",
